snippet LP "linear programming" i
\begin{align*}
&\text{minimize } \sum_{i=1}^{m} w_ix_i \\\\
	&\begin{aligned}
\text{subject to} \\\\
	&& \sum_{u \in S_i} x_i &\geq 1 && \forall  u \in U \\\\
	&& x_i &\geq 0 &&\forall  i \in \\{1,\ldots,n\\} \\\\
	\end{aligned}	
\end{align*}
endsnippet


